  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt as a single standalone metrics.aggregate node over the FluxFlow.Nodes kit: samples in, rolling MetricSnapshotOutput broadcast out, rejected-group/invalid-sample failures on the error port, diagnostics on the event port. The node factory, module, registration extensions, component-type/port constants, JSON-from-definition options reader, and design-metadata provider are removed; the clock is now an injected TimeProvider. The node depends only on FluxFlow.Nodes and runs without the engine.",
